<div class="grid gap-10 lg:gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,24rem)] lg:items-start">
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-label-md uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-emerald-700">
      Real-time community
    </p>

    <h1 class="font-display text-display-lg sm:text-5xl tracking-tight text-balance text-slate-900">
      Chat that stays fast at any scale.
    </h1>

    <p class="text-body-lg text-slate-600 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
      BeamChat is built for rooms, direct messages, live presence, county wallets, and broadcast
      radio — powered by Phoenix and LiveView so the interface stays responsive without shipping
      a separate SPA.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:items-center">
      <a href={~p"/auth/register"} class="btn btn-primary rounded-md px-8">Create an account</a>
      <a
        href={~p"/auth/login"}
        class="btn rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-slate-900"
      >
        Sign in
      </a>
    </div>

    <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 max-w-2xl">
      <div>
        <dt class="text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Transport</dt>

        <dd class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">WebSockets</dd>
      </div>

      <div>
        <dt class="text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Stack</dt>

        <dd class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Elixir · LiveView</dd>
      </div>

      <div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
        <dt class="text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Themes</dt>

        <dd class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">
          Light · Dark · System
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <aside class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-civic-2">
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Ships with this build</h2>

    <ul class="space-y-4 text-body-md text-slate-600">
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="mt-0.5 flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold">
          1
        </span>
        <span>Tenant-scoped rooms, presence, and a moderated message pipeline.</span>
      </li>

      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="mt-0.5 flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold">
          2
        </span>
        <span>Wallet-backed paid rooms, M-Pesa, and settlement audit trails.</span>
      </li>

      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="mt-0.5 flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold">
          3
        </span>
        <span>
          County radio over LiveKit — listen, manage, and archive in the Admin Console.
        </span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      API health check: <a href="/health" class="link link-primary font-medium">GET /health</a>
      · design tokens:
      <code class="font-mono text-code-sm bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded">DESIGN.md</code>
      (repo root designs folder)
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>
